WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.410
In the name of the holy Elohim,

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:12.200
in the holy names of Cassiel,
Sealtiel, Aniel, and Zerachiel,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.090
by the command of Oriphiel,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.080
Moloch, I cast thee out!

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.460
Lately, even the school grounds are 
saturated with evil presences.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:34.270
Master, I bring word from headquarters!

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.550
A battle for interim rule?

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.910
I see...

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:46.190
No wonder even the lower-ranked 
demons are acting up.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:53.690
Very well. I will banish these vile 
fiends with my own two hands.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.950
Ernest Crosby is on the job.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.120
<i>"To the wavering soul which is 
frightened of a devilish sigh,</i>

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.450
<i>if all are revealed, it will be 
to individual worship," eh?</i>

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.730
<i>Devilish sigh?</i>

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.680
<i>Does he mean those two?</i>

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.660
Lawston, letter for you.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.880
Thank you.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.400
Baker.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.110
Thanks.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.000
Passing out letters?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.570
Must be tough being a prefect.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.930
What's with the entourage?

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:08.290
Do you want to join the rugby team, too?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.570
Please.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.540
I've no intention of joining 
your gang of meatheads.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:16.610
It's thanks to him that we managed 
to beat our rival school!

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:17.860
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.630
<i>Damn him...</i>

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.090
Once a lowbrow demon, 
always a lowbrow demon.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.710
What was that?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.700
Well played.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:36.570
<i>How are they fitting in so well? 
They're supposed to be demons!</i>

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.890
Aren't they amazing?

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:41.700
They both got really popular overnight. 
You think they used magic?

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.000
Who cares?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.270
But, William, you carry Solomon's blood, right?

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.560
Ridiculous.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.660
Such myths and legends come 
from an age I know little about.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.120
Where are you going?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:04:00.080
Leave me be. All this foolish occultism 
is giving my realist brain a headache.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.810
We've got boating next period!

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.260
<i>The church should be empty. 
I can catch a nap here.</i>

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:16.940
<i>The head boy...</i>

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.400
<i>Nathan Caxton.</i>

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:28.370
He's... not playing hooky, is he?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.620
Well, well, William Twining.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.580
Come to pray in solitude?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.420
Oh, no!

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.930
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:42.670
<i>aren't priests supposed to be able 
to exorcise demons or some such?</i>

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.450
<i>If he really has noticed evil presences...</i>

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.180
<i>Then the two of them...</i>

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.420
Um...

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.610
Yes?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.810
Can priests in the Church of England

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.940
perform exorcisms, too?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:08.820
I mean, not that I believe in demons myself...

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.120
We can.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.550
One reason there are priests on campus

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.570
is because demons often take advantage

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:26.470
of emptiness in the hearts of 
young humans such as yourself.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.890
Something's troubling you, Twining.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.440
Come, tell me.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.350
Tell me your worries,

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.760
that we might sever them 
at their detestable roots.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.190
<i>If I tell Pastor Crosby about them,</i>

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.310
<i>will my life go back to normal?</i>

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.940
No, it's nothing.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.310
Excuse me.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:00.070
But, didn't you come here for some reason?

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.090
Yes.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.950
To pray for my dorm, Jacob House, 
to win the boat race!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.720
The headmaster's house has been 
walking all over us lately.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.250
I feel like God's the only 
one who can help us.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.400
I see.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.030
But it's important to give all we've got

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.730
before we start asking for help.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.530
I'll relay that to everyone.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.000
Take care.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.080
Have no fear.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:29.470
Your troubles will soon be resolved.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.010
God sees all.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.210
Ah, the Elector!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.530
He's here, Duke Dantalion!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.670
William!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.920
Where have you been?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.780
You intend to follow me again?

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:48.800
Of course!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.300
Even into the church?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.260
Solomon.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.580
Third king of Israel.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.530
Through God's gift of wisdom,

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.270
he subjugated the demons of Hell
known as the seventy-two pillars

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:08.030
and brought great prosperity to his kingdom.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.490
If I truly am the descendant of Solomon,

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:16.790
and therefore have the right to command
the Great Duke Dantalion as I see fit,

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.340
then I have only one order.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.420
Never show yourself before me again.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.210
Very well.

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:33.400
But consider this:

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:39.040
Only the seventy-two pillars
will follow your orders.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.110
Other demons will come after you.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.330
And one more thing.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:49.130
Your lineage is not the reason 
you are able to command me.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:50.860
What?!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.870
You've said your piece. Now I'll say mine.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.790
Why can't you remember?

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:58.810
Huh?

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:02.850
You're staring me right in the 
eye, and you still deny me?

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.740
Am I truly just a dream to you?

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:10.670
I can touch you.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:14.640
Am I still an illusion?

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:19.990
Get off!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.770
What nonsense are you carrying on about?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.280
Yes... This whole time, 
I've wanted to figure out...

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.500
why you don't remember me.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.160
Solomon?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.380
It's true!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.390
I saw it!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.170
A ghost!

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:00.260
You saw what?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.130
Wearing our school uniform!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.020
All right, I'll go take a look.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.990
Are you sure, William?

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.200
What'll you do if it really is a ghost?

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.650
Ghosts, eh?

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:19.480
Sounds quite intriguing.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:23.460
And who invited you to butt in?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:29.370
If it's another demon coming after you, 
you'll be in trouble, no?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.500
Did something happen 
between you and Dantalion?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.970
What? Of course not.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.600
I personally can't stand him,

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.550
but in this case, I understand how he feels.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.200
Why don't you remember?

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:49.560
Solomon was the wisest man there ever was.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.950
Yet you run from the mysteries 
staring you in the face?

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.640
And you call yourself a genius?

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.280
Your ancestors would cry.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.040
What? Me, run?!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.960
What happened?!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.050
Th-There was just...

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.920
Hey, there's no sneaking food here!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.340
You'll write twenty lines in Latin later!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.040
Is... Is that actually a real ghost?!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:36.040
Underclassmen these days are so rebellious.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.560
They don't even show prefects 
the proper respect.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.130
Oh, come off it!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.840
We need holy water...

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.540
I forgot to bring it!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.480
As if it would do anything.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:53.750
I'll fight him off, if you'll elect me.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.190
What?

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.720
Don't run from the mysteries, William.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.890
Running away won't solve anything.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.360
Sytry?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.440
This little scratch is nothing.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.610
But...

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:23.890
William, get back!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.270
Did you get him?

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:30.470
No, he escaped.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:35.860
That's no ghost. It's a demon.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:36.880
A demon?

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.450
That low-ranked demon trash...

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:43.550
I'm going to make him sorry for scratching me.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.640
The church?

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.260
Why would a demon go into the church?

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.070
Get back! Something's wrong!

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:05.550
Sytry!

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.700
Good evening.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.350
Pastor Crosby?!

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:15.680
I didn't expect the bugs to get 
caught in my net this quickly.

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:20.450
Sytry...

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.590
Viscount and 12th noble of Hell, correct?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:28.100
And candidate to be interim ruler of Hell.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.270
How did you know—

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.710
Did you exorcise that other demon, too?

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:35.940
No...

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.540
It was his familiar.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.570
Familiar?

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:45.720
Commanding demons...
Some holy man you are.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.810
What?!

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:48.950
Now I understand.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.410
So you're the Elector,

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:56.040
the mere human who sold his soul to Hell.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.750
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:03.240
I'm just a prefect trying 
to find out truth behind

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.720
the so-called ghost that's 
been terrorizing my dorm.

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.990
Fine.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:12.060
Let me rid us of this eyesore first.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.090
Sytry!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:29.490
Sytry!

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:45.590
You're only making trouble for 
yourself with all this ruckus.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:52.260
Don't worry, it's a barrier.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:53.190
What?!

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.250
If you can make barriers,

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:56.910
then why haven't you done so from the start?!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.940
I, uh... er...

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.370
Sorry.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:06.150
So you've shown yourself at last, 
Dantalion Huber.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:12.280
Or should I call you Dantalion, 
Grand Duke of Hell?

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.260
Th-That cross!

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.130
The Hand of God!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:19.960
Hand of God?

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.470
I heard a rumor...

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:26.100
There are people in the Church who 
specialize in eliminating demons.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.400
Pastor Crosby must be one of them,

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.390
part of the Church of England's 
peacekeeping division.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:32.430
In other words,

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.270
an exorcist!

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:39.420
Wait, why are demons 
working for the Church?

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.900
They're familiars,

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.990
bound to his will until their contract ends.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.870
There are too many objects 
here that weaken our powers.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.720
Shall I handle this?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.550
I have no intention of relying on you!

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:15.310
So stubborn.

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.150
Sytry!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.490
William, say that you need my help.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.530
Say it and I'll save him.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.490
I believe you know...

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.920
that I would never betray your soul.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.170
Get away from him, demon!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:51.090
William, are you okay?

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:57.060
Tell me, priest, what does the 
Church want with the Elector?

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:01.750
While he may have the right 
to choose Hell's interim ruler,

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.520
he is still a human like all of you.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:08.860
I can't imagine a clergyman doing 
anything violent to a human.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.190
Is that so?

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:15.970
Human or not, he wields the right 
to choose Hell's interim ruler,

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:19.240
and he shares a powerful bond 
with your Emperor Lucifer.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.250
We can't simply ignore that.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:21.950
Now hold on—

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:27.290
We are but servants of God, granted 
by Him the power to eliminate evil.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.740
We represent His will.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:33.590
Therefore, Elector, by the power 
vested in me by God Himself,

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.680
I must eliminate you, too.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.100
You mean kill him.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.060
Always the same...

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:47.180
Every age, every generation.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:54.320
Human beings are infinitely more cruel
and selfish than any demon in Hell.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:58.730
Very well, I will face you.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.130
I don't care what your modus operandi is.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:04.830
I can't afford to lose the Elector right now.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.670
Filthy demon!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:12.010
Hate to disappoint, but I was once like you!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.440
Wonderful expression. Very vicious.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.770
You remind me of my old self!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.690
I swear, you people have always been like this.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.570
Now if the Church of England and the
Reformists were to attack all at once,

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.990
you might make some impact.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:39.990
Dantalion!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.880
I will defile your soul,

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:47.620
and send you to the loathsome purgatory

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.790
you men of the cloth detest so much.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:54.260
You'll make a fine demon.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.390
Stop, Dantalion!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.360
Don't hamstring me. I am 
bound to obey your words.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.650
So don't stop me, William.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.400
You will stop.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.200
This will only bring more trouble.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.930
I am a human being,

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:25.700
and as long as you're here 
pretending to be one, too,

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:29.040
you will obey the laws of our world.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.550
If you're going to stop me,
then accept me.

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.270
Stop running from me!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:42.150
No matter how much you deny it, 
 Hell is close by.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.470
Whether you like it or not.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.530
Don't reject me.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.680
I am bound to you.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.480
For eternity.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.030
Eternity...

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.770
Pastor Crosby!

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.880
You see? They'll be coming after you now.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.680
These people are relentless.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.400
It's got nothing to do with me.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.700
William.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.860
Command me...

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.570
To protect you.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.590
You don't have to trust me.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.210
Or even...

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:43.050
to believe in demons or Hell.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:48.870
I'm hungry.

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.420
I want one of those cakes Baphomet makes.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.910
William—

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.910
Earlier...

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:03.050
You said, "I can touch you, 
am I still an illusion?"

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.950
Yes...

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.390
I'll prove it to you.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:07.770
What?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.100
People like you,

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.370
who keep appearing and disappearing at will,

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.690
cannot be carelessly ignored.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.400
Scientists are here to prove the 
science behind unscientific phenomena.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:21.880
So you're saying... I can stay by your side?

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:28.950
Quiet! I'm just saying I'm not 
categorically denying that you're real!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.450
That's all!

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:36.090
Don't mock realists.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:42.090
Wait up, William!

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.090
There you have it.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:44.580
You hear that, Sytry?

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:47.330
What are we going to to do now 
that this place is so busted up?

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:50.640
So we have to keep up this 
farce a while longer, then?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.170
It wasn't me. I'm not a part of this.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.650
There's no mistaking it.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:59.530
The pacts that Solomon made with the 
seventy-two demons to rule over them...

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:02.580
That power lives on inside him.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.840
William Twining is dangerous!

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.350
I heard Pastor Crosby's in the hospital.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.720
I would imagine.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.920
Good thing it wasn't too serious.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.720
It's not good at all!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.720
You can't hold public office in this country

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.380
unless you're a member of the Church!

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:25.390
If this gets out, what will come of my future?!

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.590
Baphomet has sent a cake for you.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:31.180
Let's eat it in your room, William.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:34.070
I've just received the perfect tea from home!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:36.620
Hey, don't invite yourselves!

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:49.200
<i>I wouldn't say I trust him, but...</i>

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.450
Ah, Twining, wonderful.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.670
Let me introduce you to the new priest

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:58.630
who has come to fill in for Pastor Crosby.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:03.740
Hello, everyone.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:07.010
My name is Kevin Cecil.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:08.630
Kevin?!

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:42.900
Young Master, are you well?

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:46.610
I, Kevin Cecil, simply can't 
stop worrying about you.

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:49.400
I know! I'll bet ten pounds 
that you are well!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.380
May the Lord protect you,

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.370
and if He does not, I shall.
